#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""工程 3: stage the lifecycle-advance patch for one skill-produced feature.

usage: stage_promotion.py <fixture_root> <feature_id>

Two-pass, because evaluated_digest must be the digest of the FINAL persisted
node minus confirmation_evidence:
  pass 1 -- patch lifecycle fields with a provisional evidence block, apply,
            read back the persisted node, compute the digest from it.
  pass 2 -- patch confirmation_evidence.evaluated_digest with that value.
